ghcap (0.24.1-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Redesign Commit message workflow around reusable presets and direct editing.
  * Add multiline Commit message editing with Shift+Enter and Commit confirmation.
  * Make Esc consistently return one screen at a time through Commit flow.
  * Stop depending on gh auth status --json for account discovery.
  * Keep actual Git/GitHub processing delegated to git and gh.

 -- ghcap contributors <noreply@example.com>  Wed, 07 Oct 2026 15:30:00 +0900

ghcap (0.17.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Restore V0.13-style direct account selection and add keyboard-driven account management.
  * Add keyboard-driven preset management with add, edit, delete and reorder actions.
  * Add per-repository local Git folder setup and automatic git init/remote configuration.
  * Automatically enter Git setup before Commit, Push and Commit & Push when required.
  * Remember Clone destinations as repository Git folders.
  * Add GPG setup recovery after signing failures with optional Push retry.
  * Synchronize package/version references to 0.17.0.

 -- ghcap contributors <noreply@example.com>  Wed, 07 Oct 2026 12:45:00 +0900

ghcap (0.16.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Removed all five Rust compiler warnings from the 0.13 build.
  * Removed unused GitHub availability/verification and Git change helpers.
  * Removed unused TUI parameter from message rendering.
  * Made GPG registration use the active gh account without an unused account argument.
  * Keep the GitHub device URL visible even when browser launch is unavailable.
  * Do not show a success/exit-code CUI after successful GitHub login.
  * Enforce zero Rust compiler warnings in the release build.
  * Added Cargo dependency license inspection and BSD-2-Clause project licensing.

 -- ghcap contributors <noreply@example.com>  Tue, 06 Oct 2026 16:00:00 +0900

ghcap (0.13.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Fix Result<bool, _> versus Result<(), _> control-flow errors in CUI operations.
  * Keep repository clone as a repository-level action.
  * Add unit tests for GitHub remote URL parsing.
  * Keep the login URL visible before invoking gh auth login.

 -- ghcap contributors <noreply@example.com>  Tue, 06 Oct 2026 15:00:00 +0900

ghcap (0.12.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Moved Clone into each repository menu instead of the Home menu.
  * Switched processing prompts and operation results from TUI dialogs to CUI.
  * Always display the GitHub device login URL before starting browser/device authentication.
  * Display process exit codes on operation failures where available.
  * Kept GitHub authentication and cloning based on the gh CLI.

 -- ghcap contributors <noreply@example.com>  Tue, 06 Oct 2026 15:30:00 +0900

ghcap (0.12.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Fixed the build pipeline so cargo-fmt is optional when only the Debian Rust compiler is installed.
  * Added cargo check and cargo test validation before the release build.
  * Kept Cargo.lock based reproducible dependency resolution without guessed transitive versions.
  * Retained gh CLI based GitHub authentication and repository cloning.
  * Retained local Git repository auto-detection and deterministic TUI rendering.
  * Updated displayed version to 0.12.0.

 -- ghcap contributors <noreply@example.com>  Tue, 06 Oct 2026 15:00:00 +0900
